units metal
atom_style spin
boundary p p f
atom_modify map array
read_data ref_fm.data
pair_style hybrid/overlay spin/exchange 3.700000 spin/dmi 3.000000
pair_coeff * * spin/exchange exchange 3.700000 0.03862814 0.26627693 1.7035989000
pair_coeff * * spin/dmi dmi 3.000000 0.0035 0.0 0.0 1.0
compute eEX all pair spin/exchange
compute eDMI all pair spin/dmi
compute sz all property/atom spz
compute msz all reduce ave c_sz
variable Mz equal c_msz
fix f1 all precession/spin zeeman 0.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 anisotropy 0.0 0.0 0.0 1.0
fix_modify f1 energy yes
fix f3 all nve/spin lattice frozen
thermo_style custom step pe c_eEX c_eDMI f_f1 v_Mz
thermo_modify format float %.12f
run 0
